PG  - e70381
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.70381 [doi]
LID - e70381
AB  - A 41-year-old man who had previously undergone thymoma resection developed a 
      right lower mediastinal mass. Endoscopic ultrasonography with bronchoscope-guided 
      fine-needle aspiration (EUS-B-FNA) was performed. This report shows EUS-B-FNA as 
      a minimally invasive and safe procedure that can expand the diagnostic yield for 
      recurrent thymoma.
