LID - 10.1159/000368370 [doi]
AB  - Effective use of the convex curvilinear ultrasound bronchoscope in the esophagus 
      (EUS-B) is well described. EUS-B has not been described for diagnostic sampling 
      of the left adrenal gland. We describe 6 cases of diagnostic fine-needle 
      aspiration of the left adrenal gland using EUS-B. This capacity increases the 
      diagnostic capabilities of the pulmonologist experienced in EUS-B.
