TI  - Transoesophageal Fine Needle Aspiration of Pleural Metastasis Using EBUS Scope.
PG  - 979-981
LID - 10.1159/000510801 [doi]
AB  - Endoscopic ultrasound using convex endobronchial ultrasound probe (EUS-B) is an 
      evolving diagnostic technique. We present a case of successful EUS-B biopsy of 
      pleural metastasis in a patient with lung adenocarcinoma. This was an accurate, 
      uncomplicated procedure and demonstrates the feasibility of EUS-B for pleural 
      lesions.
